    "The recommendations seem to treat heaviness as enough of a match, although melody, groove, and changes in intensity determine which heavy albums I actually want.",
    "My earlier extreme-metal listening seems to carry too much weight when my current choices lean toward heavy music with strong hooks."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Tool and Disturbed listening points toward a combination of interesting musical changes and memorable songs, which makes Mezmerize especially appealing today.",
